Copy this file to .env.backup (same folder as this example) and fill in the
production connection string.

Get it from console.prisma.io -> your project -> Database -> Connect ->
"Direct connection" (NOT the prisma+postgres:// one used by the app on
Vercel — this needs the plain postgres:// one so the pg driver can talk to
it directly).

DATABASE_URL="postgres://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:PORT/DBNAME?sslmode=require"
